{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"type":"text","text":" module provides low-level cryptographic services for sensitive card operations. Unlike "},{"code":"CardSessions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (which handles networking, session management, and token handling automatically), the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Card","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module is a pure crypto library: you manage all network calls yourself and use the SDK only for encryption and decryption.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"text":" module when you need:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Full control over the network layer (custom networking stack, interceptors, retry logic)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Integration into an architecture that doesn’t use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"async\/await"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Direct access to the encrypted keys and data for custom backend flows"}]}]}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Tip","style":"tip","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you prefer a higher-level API that handles networking and token management, use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/CardSessionsGuide","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}]}]},{"anchor":"Import","type":"heading","text":"Import","level":2},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Card"]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"Card","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module is a standalone cryptographic library that can be used without the rest of the SDK.","type":"text"}]}]},{"anchor":"Session-Token-Roles","type":"heading","text":"Session Token Roles","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend needs the following API credential roles to call the Adyen endpoints used in these flows:"}]},{"type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Operation"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Role"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Card reveal","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bank Issuing PaymentInstrument Reveal Webservice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PIN reveal"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bank Issuing Pin Reveal Webservice"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"PIN change","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bank Issuing Pin Change Webservice"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Card Reveal","anchor":"Card-Reveal"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reveal the card’s PAN, CVC, and expiry date.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Flow","level":3,"text":"Flow"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend fetches a public key from Adyen (","type":"text"},{"code":"GET \/publicKey?purpose=panReveal&format=jwk","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass the public key to the SDK to generate an encrypted session key"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend sends the encrypted key to Adyen ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/paymentInstruments\/reveal"},{"type":"text","text":") and receives encrypted card data"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass the encrypted data to the SDK to decrypt and obtain the card details","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Implementation","type":"heading","anchor":"Implementation","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Card","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the service","let cardRevealService = CardRevealService()","","\/\/ 2. Generate an encrypted key using the public key from your backend.","\/\/    The public key is the raw JWK data from the Adyen \/publicKey endpoint.","\/\/    The service retains the generated symmetric key for the decryption step.","let encryptedKey = try cardRevealService.generateEncryptedKey(","    jwk: publicKeyData",")","","\/\/ 3. Send `encryptedKey` to your backend.","\/\/    Your backend calls POST \/paymentInstruments\/reveal with:","\/\/    {","\/\/        \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"PI123...\",","\/\/        \"encryptedKey\": encryptedKey","\/\/    }","\/\/    and returns the `encryptedData` string from the response.","","\/\/ 4. Decrypt the card details using the same service instance","let details = try cardRevealService.cardDetails(","    encryptedData: encryptedData",")","","\/\/ Access the decrypted values","details.pan            \/\/ Full PAN, e.g. \"5412345678901234\"","details.cvc            \/\/ CVC, e.g. \"123\"","details.expiration.month  \/\/ e.g. \"03\"","details.expiration.year   \/\/ e.g. \"2028\""]},{"style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call ","type":"text"},{"code":"cardDetails","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on the same ","type":"text"},{"code":"CardRevealService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instance that produced the encrypted key. The instance retains the symmetric key generated by ","type":"text"},{"code":"generateEncryptedKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; calling ","type":"text"},{"code":"cardDetails","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before generating a key throws ","type":"text"},{"code":".keyNotGenerated","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","name":"Important"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you have a PEM\/DER-encoded public key instead of JWK, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey(pem:)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let encryptedKey = try cardRevealService.generateEncryptedKey(","    pem: derEncodedPublicKey",")"]},{"text":"Error Handling","type":"heading","anchor":"Error-Handling","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cardDetails"},{"type":"text","text":" throw "},{"code":"CardRevealService.CardRevealError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Error"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cause","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidPublicKey"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The public key could not be parsed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".encryptionFailed"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Key encryption failed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".keyNotGenerated","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"cardDetails","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" was called before "},{"code":"generateEncryptedKey","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidEncryptedData","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The encrypted data string is not valid hex"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".decryptionFailed","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"AES decryption of the card data failed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unexpectedData"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decryption succeeded but the payload could not be decoded"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"heading","text":"PIN Reveal","level":2,"anchor":"PIN-Reveal"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Retrieve the card’s current PIN."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Flow","anchor":"Flow","type":"heading","level":3},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend fetches a public key from Adyen ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GET \/publicKey?purpose=pinReveal&format=jwk"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pass the public key to the SDK to generate an encrypted session key"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend sends the encrypted key to Adyen (","type":"text"},{"code":"POST \/pins\/reveal","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") and receives an encrypted PIN block and token","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass both to the SDK to decrypt and obtain the PIN","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Implementation","level":3,"anchor":"Implementation"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Card","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the service","let pinRevealService = PinRevealService()","","\/\/ 2. Generate an encrypted key.","\/\/    The service retains the generated symmetric key for the decryption step.","let encryptedKey = try pinRevealService.generateEncryptedKey(","    jwk: publicKeyData",")","","\/\/ 3. Send `encryptedKey` to your backend.","\/\/    Your backend calls POST \/pins\/reveal with:","\/\/    {","\/\/        \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"PI123...\",","\/\/        \"encryptedKey\": encryptedKey","\/\/    }","\/\/    and returns `encryptedPinBlock` and `token` from the response.","","\/\/ 4. Decrypt the PIN using the same service instance","let pin = try pinRevealService.pin(","    encryptedPinBlock: encryptedPinBlock,","    token: token",")"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Error Handling","anchor":"Error-Handling"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"generateEncryptedKey","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"pin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" throw "},{"code":"PinRevealService.PinRevealError","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Error"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Cause","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidPublicKey"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The public key could not be parsed"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".encryptionFailed"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key encryption failed"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".keyNotGenerated","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"pin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" was called before ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"generateEncryptedKey"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidEncryptedData"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The encrypted PIN block is not valid"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".decryptionFailed"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decryption failed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".unexpectedData","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decrypted PIN block has an unexpected format"}]}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"text":"PIN Change","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"PIN-Change"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Set a new PIN for the card."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Flow","text":"Flow"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend fetches a public key from Adyen (","type":"text"},{"code":"GET \/publicKey?purpose=pinChange&format=jwk","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass the public key and the new PIN to the SDK to generate the encrypted payload","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend sends the payload to Adyen (","type":"text"},{"code":"POST \/pins\/change","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Implementation","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Implementation"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Card","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the service","let pinChangeService = PinChangeService()","","\/\/ 2. Generate the encrypted PIN block","let encryptedPin = try pinChangeService.encryptedPinBlock(","    jwk: publicKeyData,","    pin: newPin",")","","\/\/ 3. Send to your backend.","\/\/    Your backend calls POST \/pins\/change with:","\/\/    {","\/\/        \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"PI123...\",","\/\/        \"encryptedKey\": encryptedPin.encryptedKey,","\/\/        \"encryptedPinBlock\": encryptedPin.encryptedPinBlock,","\/\/        \"token\": encryptedPin.token","\/\/    }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you have a PEM\/DER-encoded public key:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let encryptedPin = try pinChangeService.encryptedPinBlock(","    pem: derEncodedPublicKey,","    pin: newPin",")"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Error-Handling","text":"Error Handling","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encryptedPinBlock"},{"type":"text","text":" throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PinChangeService.PinChangeError"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Error"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cause"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidPin"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The PIN is malformed (non-decimal characters, too long)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unallowedPin"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The PIN is not permitted (sequential like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1234"},{"text":", repeated like ","type":"text"},{"code":"1111","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":")","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".invalidPublicKey","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The public key could not be parsed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".encryptionFailed"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"PIN encryption failed"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Security-Considerations","text":"Security Considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"Card","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" module performs all cryptographic operations in memory. No sensitive data is written to disk.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The symmetric key generated during a reveal flow is ephemeral, held only for the lifetime of the service instance, and is never persisted or transmitted."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Display sensitive data (PAN, PIN) only temporarily and clear it from the UI promptly.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Never log or persist decrypted card details or PINs.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a fresh "},{"code":"CardRevealService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PinRevealService"},{"text":" instance per reveal operation, and generate a new encrypted key for each flow.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Migration from adyen-card-reveal-ios","anchor":"Migration-from-adyen-card-reveal-ios"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you previously used the standalone "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-card-reveal-ios"},{"type":"text","text":" package, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Card"},{"type":"text","text":" module is a drop-in replacement. The public API is unchanged; only the import name differs:"}]},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Old API","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"New API","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import AdyenCardReveal"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Card"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"generateEncryptedKey(jwk:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" → "},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unchanged"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"cardDetails(encryptedData:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"unchanged","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pin(encryptedPinBlock:, token:)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"unchanged","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encryptedPinBlock(pem:, pin:)"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unchanged"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Replace "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import AdyenCardReveal"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"code":"import Card","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; no other code changes are required."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/CardSessionsGuide"],"title":"Card Sessions","anchor":"Card-Sessions","generated":true}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/CardModuleGuide","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reveal card details, reveal PINs, and change PINs using direct service calls."}],"metadata":{"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","title":"Card (Low-Level)"},"references":{"doc://com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions/documentation/CardProvisioningSessions/CardSessionsGuide":{"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/cardprovisioningsessions\/cardsessionsguide","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/CardSessionsGuide","kind":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Securely reveal card details, reveal PINs, and change PINs."}],"title":"Card Sessions"},"https://github.com/Adyen/adyen-card-reveal-ios":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-card-reveal-ios","type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-card-reveal-ios","title":"adyen-card-reveal-ios","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"adyen-card-reveal-ios","type":"text"}]},"doc://com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions/documentation/IssuingSDKDocs":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate Adyen Issuing features into your